# Checked sessions.jsonl and direction.md first. This is the second
# idle-style mode=clear/mode=walk evening at 10-normal on a genuinely
# fresh save (the first, 2026-09-27-10, was druid:feral) and the first
# idle evening on warrior:arms at all -- its only idle appearances on
# record are single mode=raid pulls (2026-09-24, The Bonegrinder).
#
# What is actually being tested: the druid:feral idle evening never
# stalled or wiped, but past its first boss it looped forever between
# two already-lit pads (Oratory <-> Threshold) instead of ever engaging
# The Last Whisper, because cross()'s own boss-check found nothing on the
# first tick in Oratory and fell back to the pad (direction.md's #1/#6
# entry for 2026-09-27, src/main.ts:3020-3033). Whether that is a property
# of the room/seed (roomSeed is keyed off Date.now() per docs/playtest.md)
# or something an idle body specifically triggers (never walking toward
# the boss at all, unlike every other style cross() still steers the same
# way through corridors but which might behave differently once inside a
# room fight loop) is not yet settled -- this is the first same-style,
# same-size/difficulty, different-class repeat that can tell the two
# apart. Same room budget (8) and per-room seconds (200) as the prior
# idle run, so the two are a controlled pair on everything but class.
